  <Figure id="immunity-framework" />
  <ol class="method-steps">
    <li><h3>Sense</h3><p>Observe indoor conditions and occupant activity.</p></li>
    <li><h3>Model</h3><p>Explore exposure, energy use, and thermal comfort.</p></li>
    <li><h3>Inform</h3><p>Support building decisions and communicate room-level risk.</p></li>
  </ol>
  <div class="immunity-interaction">
    <Figure id="occupant-interaction" />
    <div><p class="eyebrow">People in the loop</p><h3>Health, energy, and everyday experience</h3><p>The building-immunology vision considers occupant preferences alongside environmental sensing and simulation.</p></div>
  </div>
